# lawsynth-artifact reads no environment variables. Its configuration is passed
# as explicit CLI arguments (`serve <root> <addr>`, `health <root>`,
# `gc <root> <unix-seconds> [--dry-run]`), and resource limits are compiled-in
# defaults documented under config/.
#
# Keep this file free of secrets. The optional HMAC bundle secret used by
# BundleAuthenticator is supplied in-process by an embedding application, never
# through this example. If a future deployment wrapper needs machine-specific
# paths, place them in an untracked .env and document the key here first.
#
# ARTIFACT_ROOT=/var/lib/lawsynth/artifacts   # example only; not read by the binary
